{"id":"espera","lemma":"espera","pos":"noun","rank":141,"glosses":["wait"],"ipa":"/esˈpeɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"esperas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-espera.wav","examples":[{"text":"Espera hasta las seis.","en":"Wait till six.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442959"},{"text":"¿Esperas una reacción violenta?","en":"Do you expect a backlash?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804559"},{"text":"Espera. No te vayas.","en":"Wait. Don't go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441287"},{"text":"¿Por qué esperas aquí?","en":"Why are you waiting here?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/633882"},{"text":"Espera un poco más.","en":"Wait a bit more.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586174"}]}